<li><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #35633.">Fix</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2494729133" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/35633" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/35633/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/35633">#35633</a></li>
<li><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #28969.">Fix</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1884337797" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/28969" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/28969/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/28969">#28969</a></li>
<li><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #27654.">Fix</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1780989902" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27654" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/27654/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27654">#27654</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Notable changes:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Non-standard features removed or explicitly noted as non-standard</li>
<li>Substantial information is removed from the landing page; the landing page only contains concepts</li>
<li>"Drag operations" page rewritten to only cover event firing and handling</li>
<li>"Recommended drag types" page merged into a bigger page about drag data store</li>
<li>New "Kanban board" guide to demonstrate in-page DnD, to parallel file DnD.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">I did not <span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #27654.">fix</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1780989902" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27654" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/27654/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27654">#27654</a> the way requested, because DnD in fact does not contain three distinct topics. "In-page DnD" very much uses the same features as dragging in or dragging out, it just happens that there are certain events that don't fire for dragging in or dragging out.</p>]]></content>
